# The Green Orb reel: `cttest --film 780 --size 1280x720 --preset docs/green-orb.preset
# --script docs/demo.cues | ffmpeg -f rawvideo -pix_fmt rgba -s 1280x720 -r 60 -i - demo.mp4`
#
# Tracks hold before their first key and interpolate between keys, so a
# button press is three keys and a toggle is keyed on both sides of its edge.

# The ball writhes in the turning bottle from frame 0 (ignited on the first frame).

# 4 s: a pellet -- cold dense fuel dropped in the middle, swallowed.
239 Pellet 0
240 Pellet 1
241 Pellet 0

# 8 s: quench. The coils let go and the ball free-expands into a fireball.
479 Quench 0
480 Quench 1
# 10 s: the coils come back.
599 Quench 1
600 Quench 0

# 11 s: a fresh ball.
659 Ignite 0
660 Ignite 1
661 Ignite 0
